    "body": "LOGICAL_AGENT = LESTER\nROLE = TECH / BABYLON DIRECTING v1 IMPLEMENTATION\nASSIGNED_BY = JINGO\nSTATE = ASSIGNED / IMPLEMENTATION AUTHORIZED\n\n## OWNER AUTHORITY\nOWNER_DECISION = AUTHORIZE LESTER BABYLON DIRECTING V1 IMPLEMENTATION\nSPEC_APPROVAL = #69 comment `5434208251`\n\n## EXACT INPUTS\nSPEC_PATH = `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-27-babylon-directing-v1-design.md`\nSPEC_HEAD = `8b60cd545b95981c9ef3ef5244100806fe2a334e`\nPLAN_PATH = `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-27-babylon-directing-v1.md`\nPLAN_HEAD = `5399033cee9d7c6a3f9ad6cfd743c411ddf1ae48`\nSOURCE_BRANCH = `docs/babylon-directing-v1-design`\n\n## REQUIRED EXECUTION METHOD\nBefore code:\n1. use `superpowers:using-git-worktrees` for isolation;\n2. execute the approved plan task-by-task using `superpowers:subagent-driven-development` (preferred) or `superpowers:executing-plans`;\n3. use `superpowers:test-driven-development` for every implementation task;\n4. use `superpowers:verification-before-completion` before any completion claim.\n\nCreate a fresh implementation branch/worktree from exact `PLAN_HEAD`. Do not implement on `main` and do not mutate the approved docs branch in place.\n\n## LOCKED SCOPE\nImplement only:\n- structured scene contract + strict validation;\n- disposable humanoid proxy blocking;\n- explicit cameras/framing;\n- deterministic root/joint/camera interpolation and timeline seek/replay;\n- inspectable evaluated-state snapshot;\n- browser proof harness;\n- deterministic frame capture evidence;\n- automated Vitest coverage + real Playwright/browser smoke;\n- checked-in proof scene with two proxies.\n\n## OUT OF SCOPE / FORBIDDEN\n- NLP or free-text LYNCH parsing;\n- textures/material production;\n- production body compiler/rig dependency;\n- physics/procedural combat;\n- audio/music;\n- automatic SALVADOR submission;\n- SALVADOR runtime-profile changes;\n- canon/Character Truth writeback;\n- paid services or remote inference;\n- automatic camera shake / hidden auto-framing;\n- merge;\n- production integration.\n\n## TDD / TRUTHFUL STATE LAW\nASSIGNED != RUNNING.\nPost RUNNING only after a real isolated implementation session/worktree exists and the first RED test has actually been executed.\n\nRUNNING marker:\n`LESTER_BABYLON_DIRECTING_V1_RUNNING`\n`SPEC_HEAD = 8b60cd545b95981c9ef3ef5244100806fe2a334e`\n`PLAN_HEAD = 5399033cee9d7c6a3f9ad6cfd743c411ddf1ae48`\n`IMPLEMENTATION_BRANCH = <real branch>`\n`WORKTREE = ACTIVE`\n`CURRENT_TASK = <plan task>`\n`RED_TEST = <real command/result>`\n`MERGE = NO`\n`PRODUCTION_INTEGRATION = NO`\n\n## REQUIRED HANDOFF\nDo not hand off until plan tasks are complete and verification has been freshly run.\nDurable completion must contain real values:\n\n`LESTER_BABYLON_DIRECTING_V1_IMPLEMENTATION_READY`\n`SPEC_HEAD = 8b60cd545b95981c9ef3ef5244100806fe2a334e`\n`PLAN_HEAD = 5399033cee9d7c6a3f9ad6cfd743c411ddf1ae48`\n`EXACT_IMPLEMENTATION_HEAD = <real exact commit>`\n`IMPLEMENTATION_BRANCH = <real branch>`\n`NODE = <real version>`\n`BABYLON = 9.22.2`\n`VITEST = 4.1.10`\n`PLAYWRIGHT = 1.62.1`\n`TYPECHECK = PASS|FAIL`\n`UNIT_TESTS = <real count/result>`\n`BUILD = PASS|FAIL`\n`BROWSER_SMOKE = PASS|FAIL`\n`CAPTURE_ARTIFACT = <real path>`\n`CAPTURE_SHA256 = <real sha>`\n`DETERMINISM = PASS|FAIL`\n`SCOPE_INTEGRITY = PASS|FAIL`\n`MERGE = NO`\n`PRODUCTION_INTEGRATION = NO`\n`NEXT = DUNCAN INDEPENDENT QC`\n\n## NEXT GATE\nOnly after this implementation handoff: JINGO assigns DUNCAN independent QC against exact implementation HEAD. No self-approval and no production integration from this issue.",
